  <section class="pom-about-purpose" data-pom-region="about-purpose">
    <div class="pom-fallback">
      <div class="pom-about-purpose-top">
        <div class="pom-about-purpose-title">
          <p class="pom-eyebrow">Our Purpose</p>
          <h2>To be a light<br>in our communities.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="pom-about-purpose-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="pom-about-purpose-prose">To reach the sick, lost, hurting, youth, and homeless — and to be a blessing and example in the community. We share what the Lord has done and is doing in each of our lives, so every person can be a light in their own community.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pom-about-purpose-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="pom-about-purpose-grid">
        <article>
          <h3>Reach with compassion</h3>
          <p>Serve the sick, lost, hurting, youth, and homeless with care and the hope of Christ.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Be a light</h3>
          <p>Be a blessing and example to others, sharing God’s work in our lives.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Grow in Christ</h3>
          <p>Encourage spiritual growth, maturity in Christ, and active life in a local church.</p>
        </article>
