  <section class="pom-split is-dark is-about-faith" data-pom-region="about-faith">
    <div class="pom-fallback">
      <div class="pom-split-copy" data-pom-region="about-copy">
        <div class="pom-fallback">
          <h2>Faith shapes how we serve.</h2>
          <p>Pacesetters is serving in four different programs:</p>
          <div class="pom-program-list">
            <article>
              <h3>Zoom Program</h3>
              <p>We expanded online to reach more people through a weekly “Saturday Night Live” program on Pacelive.net, headed up by Pastor Michael Vance — preaching, music, and prayer.</p>
            </article>
            <article>
              <h3>Online Store</h3>
              <p>Materials that minister to people’s lives: CDs and downloads for dating, marriage, and music; kids’ resources; t-shirts; anointing oil; and more. Our vision is to grow and share these products worldwide — and we welcome help with marketing.</p>
            </article>
            <article>
              <h3>In-person Outreach</h3>
              <p>Meetings in hotels, halls, parks, and tents — open to the public. We bus people from shelters; ministers, counselors, and prayer warriors serve those facing addiction and oppression, then provide food and donated clothing.</p>
            </article>
            <article>
              <h3>Street Outreach</h3>
              <p>Young people feed the homeless on special occasions — like Easter care packages — then pray with each person. In-person meetings are in Ohio today; our vision is to expand nationwide, and we need transportation help to grow.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pom-cms"><squarespace:block-field id="about-copy" columns="12" /></div>
      </div>
